# Monza camera verification

Commit `7aa61fb1695dd409523c463fc7df631aa37a9261`
Run `shell-20261121-082120-1` on F1 25 Steam 1.0.145, depot 26566308.
The automated test used an isolated save, only Swofty Core and the active viewport tracker. AI drove the player car. The saved-camera fallback was disabled.

| View | Driving serial | Instant Replay serial |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `wing` | 21 | 32 |
| `nose` | 20 | 24 |
| `nose_alt` | 19 | 25 |
| `chase_near` | 11 | 30 |
| `chase_far` | 14 | 31 |

All ten camera captures reported the expected kind and flag. The extra return check timed out after replay ended on Wing and the game resumed. Swofty remained on unknown with valid=0. The game exited cleanly and the stock Steam executable hash matched its pre-run value.

