## Replay-exit control

Run `shell-20261121-082522-1` used the same build and live Wing setting for both exits. After each exit the automation dismissed the pause menu and waited up to 12 seconds for a valid live view.

| Last replay view | Swofty after resuming |
| --- | --- |
| Nose | `kind=wing flags=none valid=1 serial=19` |
| Wing | `kind=unknown flags=none valid=0 serial=32` |

The same-camera timeout occurred in both runs. This comparison demonstrates when it occurred in Time Trial. It does not establish why the camera tracker missed the transition.
